  "worked_solution": "Our quantified statement reads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ **For all** $x\\in R,$ **there exists** $n\\in N$ **such that** $x<n.$\n\nThis can be re-phrased as follows:\n\n$\\,$ For every real number $x$ there is a natural number $n$ such that $x<n.$",
